<title>USA: Greenway ISD 316, Minn., won by Norwest.</title>
<headline>Greenway ISD 316, Minn., won by Norwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Inv. Svcs., said it won $1.355 million of Greenway ISD 316, Minn., general obligation school building refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of4.9230 percent.</p>
</text>
